  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a thin spherical shell of radius $R$ with centre at the origin, carrying uniform positive surface charge density. The variation of the magnitude of the electric field $|\\vec{E}(r)|$ and the electric potential $V(r)$ with the distance $r$ from the centre, is best represented by which graph?",
